cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ZFN_Design: repeat-aware, genome-scale design of zinc-finger nucleases with order-ready coding sequences"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
version: 0.8.1
date-released: "2026-11-19"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/LNT-666/ZFN_Design"
