    description: "Concept DOI, all versions"
keywords:
  - zinc finger nuclease
  - ZFN
  - genome editing
  - off-target prediction
  - codon optimization
  - repeat masking
abstract: >-
  A self-contained command-line and local-browser toolkit that turns a DNA
  sequence or a whole genome into ranked ZFN designs: candidate enumeration,
  genome-wide repeat-aware filtering (RepeatMasker annotation plus genome-wide
  copy number), six-component design scoring, genome-scale off-target burden
  estimation, and fusion-protein construction with humanized coding sequences
  and an order form.
